  "critique": {
    "axis": "aesthetics",
    "evidence": "Strong cyber-lab identity, disciplined cyan/pink palette, clear ALLOW/BLOCK contrast, and polished controls. Desktop composition is convincing, but tablet becomes excessively tall and mobile compresses labels, evidence text, captions, and header navigation to near-micro typography. The mobile results area feels dense, while the header exposes only a few destinations and gives weak visual indication that more navigation is horizontally available. Contrast verification is also incomplete for 3 tablet and 13 mobile header nodes, so an 8 is not evidenced across all viewports.",
